bro-code-mode
=============

This crate is vendored and adapted from the "code-mode" crate of the
OpenAI Codex project:

    https://github.com/openai/codex  (codex-rs/code-mode)

The original work is licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
A copy of the license terms is available at:

    http://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0

Portions Copyright OpenAI.

Local modifications by the Blackbox project:

  - `ToolName` is vendored from codex-rs/protocol into `src/tool_name.rs` and
    re-exported locally, removing the dependency on the `codex-protocol` crate.
  - Built against this workspace's pinned `v8` version (=149.2.0) rather than
    Codex's pin; runtime sources carry minor V8-API adjustments accordingly.
  - The model-facing `exec`/`wait` tool description prose (description.rs) is
    retained as a starting point and tuned for the Blackbox harness.

